# Frontend Client Environment Variables
# Optional: Set this if your backend API is hosted at a different URL/port
# In local development with Vite dev server (port 5173), Vite automatically proxies /api to http://localhost:5000
# For standalone frontend deployment (e.g. Vercel, Netlify), specify the backend base URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
